        "type": "reasoning_text",
        "text": "Interesting - there's a difference. The task says `POST /pairing/redeem` but actual is `/api/v1/pair/redeem`. Let me note that. The two-step endpoints per task: `POST /api/v1/pairing/begin` and `POST /api/v1/pairing/confirm`. Hmm, but existing routes are `/api/v1/pair/*`. Let me re-read the task:\n\n- 第一段：`POST /api/v1/pairing/begin` → 返回 `{ code, expiresAt, confirmToken }`\n- 第二段：`POST /api/v1/pairing/confirm` body `{ code, confirmToken }` → 才真正发设备令牌\n- 1.5 保留旧的单段 `POST /pairing/redeem`（回滚用），开关 `PAIR_TWO_STEP`（默认 true）\n\nSo the task uses `/api/v1/pairing/begin` and `/api/v1/pairing/confirm` paths, but existing single-stage is `/api/v1/pair/redeem`. Hmm. Let me note this discrepancy. The task key facts say \"单段 redeem 在 `/pairing/redeem`\". But actual code uses `/api/v1/pair/redeem`. \n\nWait, let me re-read the key facts from the user:\n- `pairing.ts` 有 `deviceId` + `tokenHash` + 指纹（批 26a）；单段 redeem 在 `/pairing/redeem`。\n\nBut the actual code uses `/api/v1/pair/redeem`. Hmm. There's a discrepancy between task book / user key facts and the actual code. Let me follow the actual code as the source of truth per AGENTS.md: \"接口、字段、默认值、开关名一律以代码为准\". But the endpoint paths in the task are explicit requirements. Hmm.\n\nActually, wait. Let me think about this. The task book §一 says:\n- `POST /api/v1/pairing/begin`\n- `POST /api/v1/pairing/confirm`\n- \"保留旧的单段 `POST /pairing/redeem`\"\n\nThe existing code has `/api/v1/pair/redeem`, `/api/v1/pair/code`, `/api/v1/pair/qr`, `/pair`, `/api/v1/pair/info`, `/api/v1/pair/devices`. \n\nHmm. This is a naming mismatch. The user's \"关键事实\" section says \"单段 redeem 在 `/pairing/redeem`\". But it's actually `/api/v1/pair/redeem`.\n\nThe important thing: I should honor the task's explicit endpoint paths for the NEW endpoints (begin/confirm), but I need to reconcile. Let me think about how the http probe tests work and what paths they use. Let me check the http-probe.ts to understand the test conventions. Actually the requirement says `pnpm --filter @lifediary/server http` must be green. This is the http probe script. Let me look at it.\n\nActually, I should consider: the task says \"服务端接口先就位：begin 拿 code+confirmToken，confirm 才发令牌\". So the key deliverable is the two endpoints. The exact path — task says `/api/v1/pairing/begin` and `/api/v1/pairing/confirm`. But existing is `/api/v1/pair/*`.\n\nHmm, let me look more carefully. Let me check if there's an existing http probe for pairing. Let me read the http probe and other probes for pairing to understand path conventions.\n\nActually, let me check the interface docs §7 and the baseline docs to understand the contract. Let me also check docs for pairing.\n\nLet me think about the cleanest approach that respects both: The AGENTS.md says contract is single-source in `ts/packages/shared/src/index.ts` + `docs/基线文档/接口文档.md`. But pairing endpoints are not in shared (they're HTTP endpoints defined in index.ts). Let me check the 接口文档 for pairing paths.\n\nLet me search the docs."
