      "text": "1118→\t// 会话考古（2026-11-09 T4 §4）：条件注册，不进基线 10 个工具；只读，不进 WRITE_TOOLS。\n1119→\t// 回滚：lifecycle 不传 deps.recallSessions（AGENT_RECALL_SESSIONS=false）→ 这里整块不执行。\n1120→\tif (deps.recallSessions) {\n1121→\t\tconst searchSessions = deps.recallSessions;\n1122→\t\ttools.push(\n1123→\t\t\tdefineTool({\n1124→\t\t\t\tname: \"recall_sessions\",\n1125→\t\t\t\tdescription:\n1126→\t\t\t\t\t\"在**以前所有对话的原文**里找一句话（含执事会话、群聊、任务专线）。\" +\n1127→\t\t\t\t\t\"记忆想不起来、或者要确认「上次是不是聊过这件事」时用它；只读，不改任何东西。\" +\n1128→\t\t\t\t\t\"返回会话标题、时间和命中处前后各约 100 字；查不到就返回空。\",\n1129→\t\t\t\tparameters: Type.Object({\n1130→\t\t\t\t\tquery: Type.String({ description: \"要找的内容，至少 2 个字；用关键词或一句话\" }),\n1131→\t\t\t\t\tdays: Type.Optional(\n1132→\t\t\t\t\t\tType.Number({\n1133→\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdescription: \"只搜最近多少天，默认 30\",\n1134→\t\t\t\t\t\t\tminimum: 1,\n1135→\t\t\t\t\t\t\tmaximum: 365,\n1136→\t\t\t\t\t\t}),\n1137→\t\t\t\t\t),\n1138→\t\t\t\t\tlimit: Type.Optional(\n1139→\t\t\t\t\t\tType.Number({ description: \"最多返回几条，默认 5\", minimum: 1, maximum: 20 }),\n1140→\t\t\t\t\t),\n1141→\t\t\t\t}),\n1142→\t\t\t\texecute: async (args) => {\n1143→\t\t\t\t\tlet hits: SessionSearchHit[];\n1144→\t\t\t\t\ttry {\n1145→\t\t\t\t\t\thits = await searchSessions(args.query, {\n1146→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t...(args.days === undefined ? {} : { days: args.days }),\n1147→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t...(args.limit === undefined ? {} : { limit: args.limit }),\n1148→\t\t\t\t\t\t});\n1149→\t\t\t\t\t} catch (error) {\n1150→\t\t\t\t\t\t// 只记原因，不记 query 原文（日志纪律）\n1151→\t\t\t\t\t\tconst detail = error instanceof Error ? error.message : String(error);\n1152→\t\t\t\t\t\tconsole.warn(`[recall_sessions] 检索失败: ${detail.slice(0, 200)}`);\n1153→\t\t\t\t\t\treturn textToolResult(\n1154→\t\t\t\t\t\t\terr(\"recall_failed\", \"会话检索这次没跑成。\", \"换个关键词再试；还不行就明说查不了，不要编。\"),\n1155→\t\t\t\t\t\t);\n1156→\t\t\t\t\t}\n1157→\t\t\t\t\t// 只记字数与条数，不记 query 原文与正文（D8 / 日志纪律）\n1158→\t\t\t\t\tconsole.log(`[recall_sessions] q=${args.query.length}字 hits=${hits.length}`);\n1159→\t\t\t\t\tif (hits.length === 0) {\n1160→\t\t\t\t\t\treturn textToolResult(\n1161→\t\t\t\t\t\t\tok({ count: 0, hits, message: \"没有找到相关的对话记录。\" }),\n1162→\t\t\t\t\t\t);\n1163→\t\t\t\t\t}\n1164→\t\t\t\t\treturn textToolResult(\n1165→\t\t\t\t\t\tok({\n1166→\t\t\t\t\t\t\tcount: hits.length,\n1167→\t\t\t\t\t\t\thits,\n1168→"
