      "text": "Stdout: ts/apps/server/src/agent/session.ts:104: * 会话模型与 compaction policy 决定 —— 这里没有可以接 `AUX_MODEL_COMPACT` 的入口。\nts/apps/server/src/agent/session.ts:105: * 但配置不能静默失效：只要配了 `AUX_MODEL_COMPACT`（且 `AUX_LLM` 总开关开着），\nts/apps/server/src/agent/session.ts:117:\tconsole.warn(\"[aux] 当前内核不支持指定压缩模型，AUX_MODEL_COMPACT 未生效\");\nts/apps/server/src/agent/session.ts:124: * 2026-11-10 批 26b §一：`AUX_MODEL_COMPACT` 配了也没法接（内核不收模型），这里只补\nts/apps/server/src/auxiliary.test.ts:4:\tAUX_USES,\nts/apps/server/src/auxiliary.test.ts:7:\tauxiliaryModel,\nts/apps/server/src/auxiliary.test.ts:48:\tassert.equal(auxPinnedModelId(\"extract\", { AUX_MODEL_EXTRACT: \"  \" }), null);\nts/apps/server/src/auxiliary.test.ts:50:\t\tauxPinnedModelId(\"extract\", { AUX_MODEL_EXTRACT: \" small-model \" }),\nts/apps/server/src/auxiliary.test.ts:53:\tassert.equal(auxPinnedModelId(\"title\", { AUX_MODEL_TITLE: \"t\" }), \"t\");\nts/apps/server/src/auxiliary.test.ts:54:\tassert.deepEqual([...AUX_USES], [\"title\", \"compact\", \"review\", \"extract\"]);\nts/apps/server/src/auxiliary.test.ts:58:\tassert.equal(auxiliaryModel(\"extract\", { current: null, env: {} }), null);\nts/apps/server/src/auxiliary.test.ts:63:\t\tauxiliaryModel(\"extract\", { current: CURRENT, env: {}, models: fakeModels() }),\nts/apps/server/src/auxiliary.test.ts:67:\t\tauxiliaryModel(\"extract\", {\nts/apps/server/src/auxiliary.test.ts:69:\t\t\tenv: { AUX_LLM: \"false\", AUX_MODEL_EXTRACT: \"small-model\" },\nts/apps/server/src/auxiliary.test.ts:79:\t\tauxiliaryModel(\"extract\", {\nts/apps/server/src/auxiliary.test.ts:81:\t\t\tenv: { AUX_MODEL_EXTRACT: \"small-model\" },\nts/apps/server/src/auxiliary.test.ts:90:\t\tauxiliaryModel(\"title\", {\nts/apps/server/src/auxiliary.test.ts:92:\t\t\tenv: { AUX_MODEL_TITLE: \"tiny-model\" },\nts/apps/server/src/auxiliary.test.ts:101:\t\tauxiliaryModel(\"extract\", {\nts/apps/server/src/auxiliary.test.ts:103:\t\t\tenv: { AUX_MODEL_EXTRACT: \"no-such-model\" },\nts/apps/server/src/auxiliary