        "text": "Now add the `begin`/`confirm` endpoints after `redeem`. Let me insert them right after the `redeem` handler (before `/pair/devices`).\n\nI'll write:\n```ts\n// ── 两段式配对（2026-11-10 批 28 §一）──────────────────────────────\n/**\n * 第一段：电脑端（已鉴权）起一枚两段式码。\n * code 给手机扫（进二维码），confirmToken 只回电脑端确认用，**不随二维码下发**。\n * PAIR_TWO_STEP=false 时整组两段式端点不启用（404，回到旧单段）。\n */\napp.post(\"/api/v1/pairing/begin\", (c) => {\n  if (!pairTwoStepEnabled()) return c.json({ error: \"not_found\" }, 404);\n  const { code, expiresAt, confirmToken } = pairing.begin();\n  return c.json({ code, expiresAt, confirmToken });\n});\n\n/**\n * 第二段：code + confirmToken 同时正确才发设备令牌（免鉴权，手机此刻还没有凭据）。\n * 只拿到 code 不能完成——必须有人在电脑端把 confirmToken 输进去。\n */\napp.post(\"/api/v1/pairing/confirm\", async (c) => {\n  if (!pairTwoStepEnabled()) return c.json({ error: \"not_found\" }, 404);\n  const ip = (() => {\n    try {\n      return getConnInfo(c).remote.address ?? \"local\";\n    } catch {\n      return \"local\";\n    }\n  })();\n  // 与 redeem 共用 IP 限流 + 与码共用 attempts 限流（同一类\"猜密钥\"端点）\n  if (redeemRateLimited(ip)) return c.json({ error: \"too_many_attempts\" }, 429);\n\n  const body = (await c.req.json().catch(() => null)) as\n    | { code?: string; confirmToken?: string; deviceName?: string }\n    | null;\n  const code = body?.code?.trim();\n  if (!code) return c.json({ error: \"bad_request\" }, 400);\n\n  const result = pairing.confirm(code, body?.confirmToken?.trim() ?? \"\", body?.deviceName?.trim() || \"手机\");\n  if (typeof result === \"string\") {\n    const status =\n      result === \"unknown_code\"\n        ? 404\n        : result === \"confirm_required\" || result === \"bad_confirm\"\n          ? 400\n          : result === \"code_used\"\n            ? 409\n            : result === \"code_expired\"\n              ? 410\n              : 429;\n    return c.json({ error: result }, status);\n  }\n  console.log(`[pair] 新设备已两段式配对（${ip}），当前共 ${pairing.listDevices().length} 台`);\n  return c.json({\n    deviceToken: result.deviceToken,\n    deviceId: result.deviceId,\n    ...(result.fingerprint ? { fingerprint: result.fingerprint } : {}),\n    name: hostname(),\n    version: SERVER_VERSION,\n  });\n});\n```\n\nLet me insert this after the `redeem` closing `});` (line 429 → now shifted). Let me use the `/pair/devices` line as an anchor. Actually — there are TWO `app.get(\"/api/v1/pair/devices\", ...)` — one at line 337 (the detailed one) and one at 431 (simple). Let me insert after the redeem handler's closing. Let me anchor on the `redeem` end + `/pair/devices`:\n\n```\n  });\n});\n\napp.get(\"/api/v1/pair/devices\", (c) => c.json(pairing.listDevices()));\n```\n\nHmm, that `});\\n});` is ambiguous. Let me anchor with the console.log line + the full tail of redeem. Actually, let me just use a unique longer anchor: the `name: hostname(), version: SERVER_VERSION, }); });` block. Let me include enough context.\n\nActually — the redeem handler ends with:\n```\n  console.log(`[pair] 新设备已配对（${ip}），当前共 ${pairing.listDevices().length} 台`);\n  return c.json({\n    deviceToken: result.deviceToken,\n    deviceId: result.deviceId,\n    ...(result.fingerprint ? { fingerprint: result.fingerprint } : {}),\n    name: hostname(),\n    version: SERVER_VERSION,\n  });\n});\n\napp.get(\"/api/v1/pair/devices\", (c) => c.json(pairing.listDevices()));\n```\n\nThe console.log `[pair] 新设备已配对（${ip}）` is unique (my new one will say `新设备已两段式配对`). And the block with `app.get(\"/api/v1/pair/devices\", (c) => c.json(pairing.listDevices()));` — note there are TWO `/pair/devices` GET handlers but this simple one `(c) => c.json(pairing.listDevices())` is unique. Let me anchor on the whole tail."
