    "rawContent": [
      {
        "type": "reasoning_text",
        "text": "Now let me handle §2. First, session-search.ts helpers. Let me add:\n1. `sessionSearchApiEnabled(env)` — rollback switch.\n2. `parseSessionSearchQuery(raw)` — pure validation/clamping.\n3. `findAroundIndex(messages, hit, query)` — pure, computes readTranscript-compatible index.\n\nLet me think about `findAroundIndex` signature. It takes `messages` (array of `{role, text, at}`), a `hit` (`{at, snippet}`), and `query`. Returns a number (index). Let me design:\n\n```ts\n/**\n * 命中消息在会话正文（readTranscript 口径）里的下标，供只读 UI 直接当 aroundIndex 用。\n *\n * searchSessions 的 hit 带 at（消息时间戳）与 snippet（脱敏后的 200 字窗口），但没带下标；\n * 定点找回端点 GET .../context?aroundIndex= 用的是 readTranscript(chat, 0) 的数组下标。\n * 这里用「时间一致 + 正文含命中词」在 readTranscript 结果里精确定位，取不到再退而求其次。\n * 纯函数：不碰 durable，单测可直接造消息数组断言。\n */\nexport function findAroundIndex(\n  messages: ReadonlyArray<{ text: string; at: number }>,\n  hit: { at: number },\n  query: string,\n): number {\n  const needle = query.trim().toLowerCase();\n  const exact = messages.findIndex(\n    (m) => m.at === hit.at && needle.length >= 2 && m.text.toLowerCase().includes(needle),\n  );\n  if (exact >= 0) return exact;\n  // 时间戳撞车 / 老记录没时间戳：退到\"正文含命中词\"的第一条\n  if (needle.length >= 2) {\n    const byText = messages.findIndex((m) => m.text.toLowerCase().includes(needle));\n    if (byText >= 0) return byText;\n  }\n  // 再退：按时间最接近的一条；实在没有就 0（radius 窗口仍会覆盖开头）\n  if (messages.length === 0) return 0;\n  let best = 0;\n  let bestDelta = Math.abs(messages[0]!.at - hit.at);\n  for (let i = 1; i < messages.length; i += 1) {\n    const delta = Math.abs(messages[i]!.at - hit.at);\n    if (delta < bestDelta) {\n      best = i;\n      bestDelta = delta;\n    }\n  }\n  return best;\n}\n```\n\nAnd `parseSessionSearchQuery`:\n```ts\n/** 只读搜索端点的查询参数解析（2026-11-10 批 28 §二）：纯函数，便于单测形状与空查询。 */\nexport interface SessionSearchQuery {\n  query: string;\n  options: SessionSearchOptions;\n}\nexport function parseSessionSearchQuery(raw: {\n  q?: string;\n  days?: string;\n  limit?: string;\n}): SessionSearchQuery | null {\n  const query = (raw.q ?? \"\").trim();\n  // 空 / 短查询直接拒绝（调用方回 400）；与检索核心\"短于 2 字直接空\"同阈值，\n  // 但不静默返回空命中误导 UI。\n  if (query.length < 2) return null;\n  const options: SessionSearchOptions = {};\n  const days = raw.days === undefined ? undefined : Number(raw.days);\n  const limit = raw.limit === undefined ? undefined : Number(raw.limit);\n  if (days !== undefined && Number.isFinite(days)) options.days = days;\n  if (limit !== undefined && Number.isFinite(limit)) options.limit = limit;\n  return { query, options };\n}\n```\n\nHmm — `Number(\"\")` = 0 (finite). If `days=\"\"` (empty query param), `Number(\"\")` = 0, `options.days = 0`, then `clampInt(0, 30, 1, 365)` → 1. Fine. If `days=\"abc\"` → NaN → skip → default. Good. Actually — wait, should I only accept integer strings? `Number(\"12.5\")` = 12.5 → clampInt floors it. Fine. Let me keep it simple.\n\n`sessionSearchApiEnabled`:\n```ts\n/**\n * 只读搜索端点的回滚开关（2026-11-10 批 28 §二）：默认开。\n * AGENT_SESSIONS_SEARCH=false → GET /api/v1/agent/sessions/search 整组 404（同上架开关口径）。\n */\nexport function sessionSearchApiEnabled(env: NodeJS.ProcessEnv = process.env): boolean {\n  const raw = env.AGENT_SESSIONS_SEARCH?.trim().toLowerCase();\n  if (!raw) return true;\n  return raw !== \"false\" && raw !== \"0\" && raw !== \"off\";\n}\n```\n\nNow — where to add these in session-search.ts? Let me add `sessionSearchApiEnabled` near `recallSessionsEnabled` (line 67), and `parseSessionSearchQuery` + `findAroundIndex` after `searchTranscriptLines` or near the bottom. Actually — let me add them all near the top after the constants, or after `recallSessionsEnabled`. Let me place `sessionSearchApiEnabled` right after `recallSessionsEnabled`, and the two pure functions after `searchTranscriptLines` (before `SessionReader`). Actually, order doesn't matter much (function declarations are hoisted). Let me add them at logical spots.\n\nLet me now write the edits. First `sessionSearchApiEnabled` after `recallSessionsEnabled`."
      }
