    "rawContent": [
      {
        "type": "reasoning_text",
        "text": "Now write the §2.4 tests. Let me update the import in session-search.test.ts and append tests.\n\nImport:\n```ts\nimport {\n\tSNIPPET_MAX_CHARS,\n\tfindAroundIndex,\n\tparseSessionSearchQuery,\n\trecallSessionsEnabled,\n\tsearchSessions,\n\tsearchTranscriptLines,\n\tsessionSearchApiEnabled,\n\ttype SessionReader,\n\ttype TranscriptSource,\n} from \"./session-search.ts\";\n```\n\nTests:\n```ts\n// ── 只读搜索端点（2026-11-10 批 28 §二）──────────────────────────────\ntest(\"搜索端点参数：空/短查询 → null（400）；形状与 days·limit 收敛\", () => {\n\tassert.equal(parseSessionSearchQuery({ q: \"  \" }), null, \"空查询 → null\");\n\tassert.equal(parseSessionSearchQuery({ q: \"爬\" }), null, \"短于 2 字 → null\");\n\tassert.equal(parseSessionSearchQuery({}), null, \"缺 q → null\");\n\tassert.deepEqual(parseSessionSearchQuery({ q: \"  爬山  \", days: \"60\", limit: \"3\" }), {\n\t\tquery: \"爬山\",\n\t\toptions: { days: 60, limit: 3 },\n\t});\n\tassert.deepEqual(parseSessionSearchQuery({ q: \"爬山\", days: \"abc\", limit: \"\" }), {\n\t\tquery: \"爬山\",\n\t\toptions: {},   // 非数字 / 空串都不塞进 options，交给检索核心回落\n\t});\n\tassert.equal(sessionSearchApiEnabled({}), true, \"缺省开\");\n\tassert.equal(sessionSearchApiEnabled({ AGENT_SESSIONS_SEARCH: \"false\" }), false);\n\tassert.equal(sessionSearchApiEnabled({ AGENT_RECALL_SESSIONS: \"false\" }), true, \"与工具开关互不牵连\");\n});\n\ntest(\"搜索端点结果：命中形状固定、snippet ≤200 不含整段正文；aroundIndex 与定点找回同源\", async () => {\n\tprocess.env.AGENT_CHAT_META_PATH = join(tmpdir(), \"lifediary-no-such-chat-meta-2.json\");\n\tconst longText = `${\"甲\".repeat(150)}马拉松${\"乙\".repeat(150)}`;\n\tconst at = NOW - DAY;\n\tconst reader: SessionReader = {\n\t\tasync snapshot() {\n\t\t\treturn { byExternal: { \"conv-a\": 1 } };\n\t\t},\n\t\tasync conversation() {\n\t\t\treturn {\n\t\t\t\tcontext: async () => ({\n\t\t\t\t\tentries: [\n\t\t\t\t\t\t{ kind: \"pi.user\", model: [{ role: \"user\", content: [{ type: \"text\", text: \"先聊点别的\" }], timestamp: at - 1000 }] },\n\t\t\t\t\t\t{ kind: \"pi.user\", model: [{ role: \"user\", content: [{ type: \"text\", text: longText }], timestamp: at }] },\n\t\t\t\t\t],\n\t\t\t\t}),\n\t\t\t} as never;\n\t\t},\n\t};\n\tconst parsed = parseSessionSearchQuery({ q: \"马拉松\" })!;\n\tconst hits = await searchSessions(reader, parsed.query, parsed.options, NOW);\n\tassert.equal(hits.length, 1);\n\tconst hit = hits[0]!;\n\t// 形状：只有这四个字段，没有把整段正文塞进来\n\tassert.deepEqual(Object.keys(hit).sort(), [\"at\", \"conversationId\", \"snippet\", \"title\"].sort());\n\tassert.ok(hit.snippet.length <= SNIPPET_MAX_CHARS, \"snippet 不得超过 200 字\");\n\tassert.ok(!hit.snippet.includes(\"乙\".repeat(150)), \"不带整段正文\");\n\tassert.ok(hit.snippet.includes(\"马拉松\"));\n\n\t// 模拟定点找回端点的 readTranscript 结果：命中那条在下标 1\n\tconst messages = [\n\t\t{ text: \"先聊点别的\", at: at - 1000 },\n\t\t{ text: longText, at },\n\t];\n\tassert.equal(findAroundIndex(messages, hit, \"马拉松\"), 1, \"时间 + 命中词精确定位到下标 1\");\n});\n```\n\nHmm — the `Object.keys(hit).sort()` — `searchTranscriptLines` pushes `{conversationId, title, at, snippet}`. So keys are exactly those 4. Good. But — wait, does `searchSessions` add any extra? No, it returns `searchTranscriptLines(...)` hits directly. Good.\n\nAlso — `findAroundIndex(messages, hit, \"马拉松\")`: `hit.at = at` (the timestamp of the long line). `messages[1] = {text: longText, at}`. The exact match: `m.at === hit.at && m.text.toLowerCase().includes(\"马拉松\")` → messages[1] matches → returns 1. ✓. Good.\n\nWait — but `searchSessions` builds `lines` with `at = message.timestamp`. And `readTranscript` for a `pi.user` message uses `at = message.timestamp`. So they align. ✓. My `messages` mock uses `at` = same timestamp. Good.\n\nLet me also add a `findAroundIndex` fallback test (needle not found → nearest by time):\n```ts\ntest(\"findAroundIndex 兜底：命中词找不到时按时间就近；空消息回 0\", () => {\n\tconst messages = [\n\t\t{ text: \"甲\", at: 100 },\n\t\t{ text: \"乙\", at: 200 },\n\t\t{ text: \"丙\", at: 300 },\n\t];\n\tassert.equal(findAroundIndex(messages, { at: 210 }, \"不存在\"), 1);\n\tassert.equal(findAroundIndex([], { at: 0 }, \"马拉松\"), 0);\n});\n```\n\nGood. Let me write these. Let me first update the import."
      }
    ],
