          "value": "17:  --card-high: #ede9e0;\n22:  --divider: rgba(200, 197, 188, 0.55);\n25:  --c-on-primary: #ffffff;\n36:  --c-error: #b3564d;\n65:  --r-sm: 8px;\n66:  --r-md: 12px;\n79:  --mono: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \"SF Mono\", Menlo, Consolas, monospace;\n124:  --card-high: #ededea;\n129:  --divider: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.10);\n133:  --c-on-primary: #ffffff;\n144:  --c-error: #b3564d;\n174:  --card-high: #212433;\n179:  --divider: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);\n183:  --c-on-primary: #101223;\n194:  --c-error: #e5a9a2;\n226:  --card-high: #242429;\n231:  --divider: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);\n234:  --c-on-primary: #0a0a12;\n245:  --c-error: #e5a9a2;\n272:  --accent: var(--c-primary);\n=== tail of style.css ===\n  display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;\r\n  margin-top: 8px;\r\n}\r\n.topic-proposal-q {\r\n  margin: 0;\r\n  font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.55;\r\n}\r\n.topic-proposal-meta {\r\n  display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\r\n  font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-2);\r\n}\r\n.topic-proposal-expiry { font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text-3); }\r\n.topic-proposal-state { margin: 0; font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-2); }\r\n.topic-proposal-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-top: 2px; }\r\n.topic-proposal-actions[hidden] { display: none; }\r\n.topic-proposal-note {\r\n  margin: 0; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--text-2);\r\n}\r\n.topic-proposal-note.is-error { color: var(--c-error); }\r\n.topic-proposal-link {\r\n  border: 0; background: none; padding: 0 0 1px;\r\n  font: inherit; font-size: 12px;\r\n  cursor: pointer;\r\n}\r\n.topic-proposal.resolved { opacity: .72; }"
