        "type": "reasoning_text",
        "text": "Good. Now let me write the frontend code. I'll:\n1. Add the \"找旧事\" row in the chats settings section.\n2. Add `openRecallModal()` function (near `wireSettingsSearch` or near the modal helpers). Let me place it right after `wireSettingsSearch` (line 10213) since it's settings-related and uses `request`, `esc`, `openModal`.\n\nActually — let me place `openRecallModal` right after `wireSettingsSearch` ends (line 10213). And wire the button in the chats section (line ~10458 `wireSettingsSearch();`).\n\nLet me write `openRecallModal`. I need to be careful with:\n- `esc()` requires a string. I'll use a local `safe()` helper: `const safe = (v) => esc(String(v ?? \"\"));`. Actually — `esc` already handles strings; let me just wrap: `esc(String(hit.title ?? \"\"))`. Hmm, verbose. Let me define `const safe = (v) => esc(String(v ?? \"\"));` inside the function.\n- `request()` returns a Response (throws \"forbidden\" on 403). I need to check `resp.ok` and `resp.status`.\n- The context endpoint returns 503 with `{ok:false, reason:\"llm_not_configured\"}` or 404 `{error:\"unknown_conversation\"}` or 400. I'll handle non-ok generically.\n- Search endpoint returns 400 for empty query, 404 if switch off. I'll handle.\n\nLet me write the function:\n\n```js\n/**\n * 「找旧事」（2026-11-10 批 28 §二）：只读 UI。\n * 关键词 → GET /api/v1/agent/sessions/search → 结果列表 → 点一条用 aroundIndex 拉\n * GET /api/v1/agent/chat/:id/context?aroundIndex=&radius= 弹窗看前后文。\n * 不 fork、不新开会话、不改任何东西（服务端两个端点也都只读）。\n */\nfunction openRecallModal() {\n  const safe = (v) => esc(String(v ?? \"\"));\n  openModal(\n    \"找旧事\",\n    (body) => {\n      body.innerHTML = `\n        <p class=\"modal-desc\">在所有旧会话的原文里搜一句话，点一条看前后文。只读，不会改动或新开会话。</p>\n        <div class=\"modal-row\">\n          <input class=\"modal-input\" id=\"recall-q\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"关键词，至少 2 个字\" aria-label=\"找旧事关键词\" />\n          <button class=\"btn-primary\" type=\"button\" id=\"recall-go\">查找</button>\n        </div>\n        <div id=\"recall-results\" class=\"recall-results\"><div class=\"set-hint\">输入关键词开始查找。</div></div>\n        <div id=\"recall-context\" class=\"recall-context\" hidden></div>\n      `;\n      const input = body.querySelector(\"#recall-q\");\n      const results = body.querySelector(\"#recall-results\");\n      const contextBox = body.querySelector(\"#recall-context\");\n\n      const renderHits = (hits) => {\n        contextBox.hidden = true;\n        contextBox.replaceChildren();\n        results.hidden = false;\n        results.replaceChildren();\n        if (!hits.length) {\n          results.innerHTML = `<div class=\"set-hint\">没有找到相关的旧事。</div>`;\n          return;\n        }\n        for (const hit of hits) {\n          const row = document.createElement(\"button\");\n          row.type = \"button\";\n          row.className = \"recall-hit\";\n          row.innerHTML = `\n            <span class=\"recall-hit-head\">\n              <span class=\"recall-hit-title\">${safe(hit.title || \"（无标题）\")}</span>\n              <span class=\"recall-hit-time\">${safe(new Date(hit.at).toLocaleString(\"zh-CN\"))}</span>\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"recall-hit-snippet\">${safe(hit.snippet)}</span>\n          `;\n          row.addEventListener(\"click\", () => void showContext(hit));\n          results.append(row);\n        }\n      };\n\n      const showContext = async (hit) => {\n        results.hidden = true;\n        contextBox.hidden = false;\n        contextBox.innerHTML = `<div class=\"set-hint\">读取上下文…</div>`;\n        try {\n          const resp = await request(\n            `/api/v1/agent/chat/${encodeURIComponent(hit.conversationId)}/context?aroundIndex=${encodeURIComponent(hit.aroundIndex)}&radius=5`,\n            { cache: \"no-store\" },\n          );\n          if (!resp.ok) {\n            contextBox.innerHTML = `<div class=\"set-hint is-error\">读不到上下文（${resp.status}）。</div>`;\n            return;\n          }\n          const data = await resp.json();\n          const head = document.createElement(\"div\");\n          head.className = \"recall-ctx-head\";\n          head.innerHTML = `\n            <button class=\"ghost\" type=\"button\" id=\"recall-back\">← 返回结果</button>\n            <span class=\"recall-ctx-meta\">${safe(hit.title || \"会话\")} · 共 ${safe(data.total)} 条 · 第 ${safe(data.from)}–${safe(data.to)} 条</span>\n          `;\n          contextBox.replaceChildren(head);\n          head.querySelector(\"#recall-back\")?.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n            contextBox.hidden = true;\n            contextBox.replaceChildren();\n            results.hidden = false;\n          });\n          for (const msg of data.messages || []) {\n            const line = document.createElement(\"div\");\n            const hitClass = Number(msg.index) === Number(hit.aroundIndex) ? \" recall-msg-hit\" : \"\";\n            line.className = `recall-msg ${msg.role === \"user\" ? \"recall-msg-user\" : \"recall-msg-assistant\"}${hitClass}`;\n            line.innerHTML = `\n              <div class=\"recall-msg-meta\">${msg.role === \"user\" ? \"我\" : \"Selenite\"} · ${safe(new Date(msg.at).toLocaleString(\"zh-CN\"))} · #${safe(msg.index)}</div>\n              <div class=\"recall-msg-text\">${safe(msg.text || \"（空）\")}</div>\n            `;\n            contextBox.append(line);\n          }\n        } catch (error) {\n          contextBox.innerHTML = `<div class=\"set-hint is-error\">读不到上下文：${safe(error.message)}</div>`;\n        }\n      };\n\n      const runSearch = async () => {\n        const q = input.value.trim();\n        if (q.length < 2) {\n          results.hidden = false;\n          results.innerHTML = `<div class=\"set-hint\">关键词至少 2 个字。</div>`;\n          contextBox.hidden = true;\n          return;\n        }\n        results.hidden = false;\n        results.innerHTML = `<div class=\"set-hint\">查找中…</div>`;\n        contextBox.hidden = true;\n        try {\n          const resp = await request(\n            `/api/v1/agent/sessions/search?q=${encodeURIComponent(q)}&days=365&limit=20`,\n            { cache: \"no-store\" },\n          );\n          if (!resp.ok) {\n            results.innerHTML = `<div class=\"set-hint is-error\">查找失败（${resp.status}）。</div>`;\n            return;\n          }\n          const data = await resp.json();\n          renderHits(data.hits || []);\n        } catch (error) {\n          results.innerHTML = `<div class=\"set-hint is-error\">查找失败：${safe(error.message)}</div>`;\n        }\n      };\n\n      body.querySelector(\"#recall-go\")?.addEventListener(\"click\", () => void runSearch());\n      input?.addEventListener(\"keydown\", (event) => {\n        if (event.key === \"Enter\") void runSearch();\n      });\n    },\n    { className: \"modal-wide\" },\n  );\n}\n```\n\nHmm — there's a subtlety: `showContext` is defined AFTER `renderHits` but `renderHits` references `showContext`. Since these are `const` arrow functions inside the `build` callback, and `renderHits` is only CALLED after both are defined (via `runSearch` → `renderHits`), the closure works (no TDZ issue at call time). Actually — `renderHits` is defined first, referencing `showContext` which is defined later. At the time `renderHits` is CALLED, `showContext` is initialized. Fine (JS closures resolve at call time). Good.\n\nWait — but `runSearch` is defined after `showContext`. And `body.querySelector(\"#recall-go\")?.addEventListener(... () => void runSearch())` — `runSearch` is defined before that line. Good.\n\nAlso — `openModal` calls `build(el.modalBody)` synchronously, and then focuses the first input. So my `input` etc. are captured during build. Good.\n\nNow — one concern: `openModal`'s `build` receives `el.modalBody`. But I'm using `body.innerHTML = ...` and then `body.querySelector(...)`. Good. But note — `openModal` does `el.modalBody.replaceChildren()` BEFORE calling build. So body is empty. Good.\n\nAnother concern: when the user closes the modal, `el.modalBody.replaceChildren()` is called by `closeModal`. My event listeners are on elements inside body → garbage collected. Fine.\n\nNow — `data.total`, `data.from`, `data.to` are numbers. `safe(number)` → `esc(String(number))` → fine.\n\n`hit.aroundIndex` — number (from my endpoint). `encodeURIComponent(hit.aroundIndex)` → string. Good. If undefined (e.g., old data), `encodeURIComponent(undefined)` → \"undefined\" → the context endpoint would return 400 (bad_request). Hmm — let me guard: `const around = Number.isFinite(Number(hit.aroundIndex)) ? Number(hit.aroundIndex) : 0;`. Actually — my endpoint always returns `aroundIndex`. But to be robust, let me compute: `const around = Number(hit.aroundIndex) || 0;`. Hmm — `Number(undefined)` = NaN → `NaN || 0` = 0. `Number(5)` = 5. Good. Let me use that.\n\nActually — let me keep it simple but robust. Let me add `const around = Number.isInteger(Number(hit.aroundIndex)) ? Number(hit.aroundIndex) : 0;` Hmm. Let me just use `const around = Number(hit.aroundIndex) || 0;` — but `Number(\"0\")` = 0 → `0 || 0` = 0. Fine. `Number(\"5\")` = 5. Good.\n\nHmm — actually `hit.aroundIndex` from my endpoint is a number (from `findAroundIndex` which returns a number). `JSON.stringify` → number. `data.hits` parsed → number. Good. So `encodeURIComponent(hit.aroundIndex)` works. But let me add the guard anyway for robustness. Actually — let me keep it minimal and just use `hit.aroundIndex` directly (it's guaranteed by my endpoint). But if the endpoint is an older version without aroundIndex, it'd break. Since I control both, it's fine. Let me add a light guard: use `hit.aroundIndex ?? 0`.\n\nLet me simplify: `aroundIndex=${encodeURIComponent(hit.aroundIndex ?? 0)}`. Good.\n\nNow — the CSS. Let me add a block at the end of style.css:\n\n```css\n/* ── 找旧事（2026-11-10 批 28 §二）：只读的旧会话检索弹窗 ────────── */\n.recall-results {\n  display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;\n  max-height: 46vh; overflow-y: auto;\n}\n.recall-results[hidden], .recall-context[hidden] { display: none; }\n.recall-hit {\n  display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;\n  width: 100%; padding: 10px 12px;\n  text-align: left;\n  background: var(--card);\n  border: 1px solid var(--outline); border-radius: var(--r-md);\n  color: var(--text); cursor: pointer;\n}\n.recall-hit:hover { background: var(--card-high); border-color: var(--accent); }\n.recall-hit:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 2px; }\n.recall-hit-head {\n  display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px;\n}\n.recall-hit-title { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }\n.recall-hit-time { flex: none; font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text-3); }\n.recall-hit-snippet {\n  font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--text-2);\n  overflow-wrap: anywhere; white-space: pre-wrap;\n}\n.recall-context {\n  display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;\n  max-height: 52vh; overflow-y: auto;\n}\n.recall-ctx-head {\n  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\n  padding-bottom: 4px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--divider);\n}\n.recall-ctx-meta { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-2); }\n.recall-msg {\n  display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 3px;\n  padding: 8px 10px;\n  background: var(--card); border-radius: var(--r-md);\n  border: 1px solid transparent;\n}\n.recall-msg-user { background: var(--card); }\n.recall-msg-assistant { background: var(--surface); }\n.recall-msg-hit { border-color: var(--accent); }\n.recall-msg-meta { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-3); }\n.recall-msg-text {\n  font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--text);\n  overflow-wrap: anywhere; white-space: pre-wrap;\n}\n```\n\nHmm — `.ghost` and `.btn-primary` classes exist (used elsewhere). Good.\n\nNow — I need to check: `input` value — `input.value.trim()` where `input = body.querySelector(\"#recall-q\")`. Good. And `openModal` focuses the first input automatically. Good.\n\nNow — the \"找旧事\" entry row. Let me add it in the chats section. Let me re-read the exact chats section HTML to insert at the right place. I'll add after `<div id=\"content-results\"></div>` and before the \"回车发送\" divider. Actually — let me add it right after the \"搜索会话\" row's results blocks. Let me look:\n\n```\n${rowMarkup(\n  \"搜索会话\",\n  \"先按标题/第一句找；输入 2 字以上还会搜正文内容\",\n  `<input class=\"chat-search\" id=\"settings-search\" ... />`,\n)}\n<div class=\"divider\"></div>\n<div id=\"search-results\"></div>\n<div id=\"content-results\"></div>\n${rowMarkup(\n  \"回车发送\",\n  ...\n```\n\nI'll insert a \"找旧事\" row + divider between `<div id=\"content-results\"></div>` and `${rowMarkup(\"回车发送\", ...)}`.\n\nActually — hmm, the search-results/content-results divs are populated by `wireSettingsSearch` on input. Adding a \"找旧事\" row right after them is fine. Let me insert:\n```\n<div id=\"content-results\"></div>\n<div class=\"divider\"></div>\n${rowMarkup(\n  \"找旧事\",\n  \"在所有旧会话的原文里搜一句话，点结果看前后文（只读，不新开会话）\",\n  `<button class=\"ghost\" type=\"button\" id=\"open-recall\">查找…</button>`,\n)}\n<div class=\"divider\"></div>\n${rowMarkup(\"回车发送\", ...)}\n```\nWait — there's already a `<div class=\"divider\"></div>` before \"回车发送\"? Let me re-read: \n```\n<div id=\"search-results\"></div>\n<div id=\"content-results\"></div>\n${rowMarkup(\"回车发送\", ...)}\n<div class=\"divider\"></div>\n${rowMarkup(\"工具活动\", ...)}\n```\nSo there's NO divider between content-results and 回车发送. Let me add my row with dividers around it. So:\n```\n<div id=\"content-results\"></div>\n<div class=\"divider\"></div>\n${rowMarkup(\"找旧事\", ..., `<button ... id=\"open-recall\">查找…</button>`)}\n<div class=\"divider\"></div>\n${rowMarkup(\"回车发送\", ...)}\n```\nGood.\n\nAnd wire: `document.getElementById(\"open-recall\")?.addEventListener(\"click\", () => openRecallModal());` in the chats branch near `wireSettingsSearch();`.\n\nLet me now make the edits. First add `openRecallModal` after `wireSettingsSearch`. Let me anchor on the end of `wireSettingsSearch` (line 10213 `}`). Actually — let me anchor on the `renderHits` closing + the function close. Let me use the unique tail:\n```\n  }, 300);\n});\n```\nHmm — that appears in `wireSettingsSearch`. Let me use a longer unique anchor:\n```\n    }, 300);\n  });\n}\n\n/** 一行设置 = 标签 + 控件。\n```\nThat's unique. Let me insert `openRecallModal` between `}` and `/** 一行设置`."
