      {
        "type": "reasoning_text",
        "text": "`Harness.open` uses `currentModels` (an accessor) and `storage`. It doesn't obviously require `readLlmConfig()`. `models: currentModels` is a function that returns the current model catalog. Even without a configured model, it would open with an empty catalog. So `getHarness()` should work even with `LLM_API_KEY=\"\"` (faux provider still registers a faux model). In the probe, `LLM_PROVIDER=faux` → there IS a faux model. So `getHarness()` works.\n\nActually — `searchSessions` calls `reader.snapshot(Chats, CTX)` which reads durable. That works regardless of models. So my endpoint should work in the probe. Let me proceed with §31 including a basic sessions/search shape check.\n\nBut — hold on: there's a concern with `openChat()` in my endpoint. For `sessions/search` with NO hits (empty query result), my endpoint's `for (const hit of hits)` loop doesn't execute, so `openChat` is never called. So no `readLlmConfig()` dependency. Good. So `GET /api/v1/agent/sessions/search?q=不存在的词` → `searchSessions` returns `[]` → `{hits: []}`. No `openChat` call. \n\nSo the §31 sessions/search tests (empty q → 400, short q → 400, no-hit q → 200 `{hits:[]}`) don't call `openChat`. Good, robust.\n\nNow — let me also reconsider: `getHarness()` is called even for the no-hit case (via `searchSessions(await getHarness(), ...)`). If `getHarness()` works (it should), fine.\n\nLet me now write the probe edits.\n\nEdit 1: line 2811 — add `PAIR_TWO_STEP: \"false\"`.\n```ts\nserver = startServer({ COMPANIONS_ENABLED: \"true\", AGENT_BASH_BG_TIMEOUT: \"\", PAIR_TWO_STEP: \"false\" });\n```\nWait — but §29 (bg-jobs off) runs on this server too. `PAIR_TWO_STEP=false` only affects pairing endpoints. Fine.\n\nEdit 2: after §30 (line 2854), insert §31. Let me write:\n\n```ts\n\t// ── 31. 两段式配对 + 找旧事搜索端点（2026-11-10 批 28）──\n\t// 真起一个 PAIR_TWO_STEP=true 的服务：验「只扫码不能完成」、confirm 才发令牌、重放失效、\n\t// 单段 redeem 被收紧关闭；顺带验只读搜索端点的 400/形状。\n\tconsole.log(\"\\n· 31. 两段式配对 + 找旧事搜索端点（批 28）\");\n\tserver.kill();\n\tawait sleep(800);\n\tserver = startServer({ PAIR_TWO_STEP: \"true\", PAIRING_STORE_PATH: \".data/probe-http-pairing-2step.json\" });\n\tawait waitForReady();\n\n\tconst beginResp = await fetch(`${BASE}/api/v1/pairing/begin`, { method: \"POST\" });\n\tconst begun = (await beginResp.json()) as { code?: string; expiresAt?: number; confirmToken?: string };\n\tcheck(\n\t\tbeginResp.status === 200 && typeof begun.code === \"string\" &&\n\t\ttypeof begun.confirmToken === \"string\" && begun.confirmToken.length >= 20,\n\t\t\"begin 返回 code + expiresAt + confirmToken\",\n\t\t`${beginResp.status} ct=${begun.confirmToken?.length}`,\n\t);\n\n\t// 只给 code（不输 confirmToken）→ 不能完成配对\n\tconst onlyCode = await fetch(`${BASE}/api/v1/pairing/confirm`, {\n\t\tmethod: \"POST\",\n\t\theaders: { \"content-type\": \"application/json\" },\n\t\tbody: JSON.stringify({ code: begun.code }),\n\t});\n\tconst onlyCodeBody = (await onlyCode.json()) as { error?: string; deviceToken?: string };\n\tcheck(\n\t\tonlyCode.status === 400 && onlyCodeBody.error === \"confirm_required\" && !onlyCodeBody.deviceToken,\n\t\t\"只扫码（只有 code）不能完成配对\",\n\t\t`${onlyCode.status} ${onlyCodeBody.error}`,\n\t);\n\n\t// confirmToken 错 → 拒绝\n\tconst badConfirm = await fetch(`${BASE}/api/v1/pairing/confirm`, {\n\t\tmethod: \"POST\",\n\t\theaders: { \"content-type\": \"application/json\" },\n\t\tbody: JSON.stringify({ code: begun.code, confirmToken: \"错的令牌\" }),\n\t});\n\tconst badConfirmBody = (await badConfirm.json()) as { error?: string };\n\tcheck(\n\t\tbadConfirm.status === 400 && badConfirmBody.error === \"bad_confirm\",\n\t\t\"confirmToken 错 → 400 bad_confirm\",\n\t\t`${badConfirm.status} ${badConfirmBody.error}`,\n\t);\n\n\t// 单段 redeem 在两段式默认开时被收紧关闭（不能凭 code 单段兑）\n\tconst oldRedeem = await fetch(`${BASE}/api/v1/pair/redeem`, {\n\t\tmethod: \"POST\",\n\t\theaders: { \"content-type\": \"application/json\" },\n\t\tbody: JSON.stringify({ code: begun.code, deviceName: \"探针手机\" }),\n\t});\n\tconst oldRedeemBody = (await oldRedeem.json()) as { error?: string };\n\tcheck(\n\t\toldRedeem.status === 410 && oldRedeemBody.error === \"two_step_required\",\n\t\t\"PAIR_TWO_STEP=true 时单段 redeem 关闭（只扫码兑不到）\",\n\t\t`${oldRedeem.status} ${oldRedeemBody.error}`,\n\t);\n\n\t// code + confirmToken 都交齐 → 才发令牌\n\tconst confirmResp = await fetch(`${BASE}/api/v1/pairing/confirm`, {\n\t\tmethod: \"POST\",\n\t\theaders: { \"content-type\": \"application/json\" },\n\t\tbody: JSON.stringify({ code: begun.code, confirmToken: begun.confirmToken, deviceName: \"探针手机\" }),\n\t});\n\tconst confirmBody = (await confirmResp.json()) as { deviceToken?: string; deviceId?: string };\n\tcheck(\n\t\tconfirmResp.status === 200 && typeof confirmBody.deviceToken === \"string\",\n\t\t\"两段式都交齐才发设备令牌\",\n\t\tString(confirmResp.status),\n\t);\n\n\t// 重放 → code_used（confirmToken 一次性）\n\tconst replay = await fetch(`${BASE}/api/v1/pairing/confirm`, {\n\t\tmethod: \"POST\",\n\t\theaders: { \"content-type\": \"application/json\" },\n\t\tbody: JSON.stringify({ code: begun.code, confirmToken: begun.confirmToken }),\n\t});\n\tconst replayBody = (await replay.json()) as { error?: string };\n\tcheck(\n\t\treplay.status === 409 && replayBody.error === \"code_used\",\n\t\t\"confirmToken 一次性：重放 → 409 code_used\",\n\t\t`${replay.status} ${replayBody.error}`,\n\t);\n\n\t// 找旧事只读搜索端点：空/短查询 400，正常查询形状 hits 数组（无命中给空）\n\tconst ssEmpty = await fetch(`${BASE}/api/v1/agent/sessions/search?q=`);\n\tcheck(ssEmpty.status === 400, \"sessions/search 空查询 → 400\", String(ssEmpty.status));\n\tconst ssShort = await fetch(`${BASE}/api/v1/agent/sessions/search?q=%E7%88%AC`);\n\tcheck(ssShort.status === 400, \"sessions/search 短查询 → 400\", String(ssShort.status));\n\tconst ssOk = await fetch(`${BASE}/api/v1/agent/sessions/search?q=%E4%B8%8D%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%8Dxyz&days=365&limit=5`);\n\tconst ssBody = (await ssOk.json()) as { hits?: unknown[] };\n\tcheck(\n\t\tssOk.status === 200 && Array.isArray(ssBody.hits),\n\t\t\"sessions/search 正常查询 → 200 {hits:[]}\",\n\t\t`${ssOk.status} ${JSON.stringify(ssBody).slice(0, 60)}`,\n\t);\n```\n\nHmm — wait, the `confirmToken 错` test increments `attempts` (1). Then `oldRedeem` — with PAIR_TWO_STEP=true, `redeem` returns 410 BEFORE calling store.redeem, so attempts not affected. Then `confirm` with correct token — attempts=1, fine (< 5). Success. Good. Then `replay` → `code_used`. \n\nBut — hold on: after `onlyCode` (confirm with no token) → attempts=1. `badConfirm` → attempts=2. `oldRedeem` → 410 (no store call, no attempt). `confirmResp` (correct) → attempts=2, proceeds → success. Good. That works.\n\nHmm — wait, actually there's a subtlety: `onlyCode` calls `pairing.confirm(code, \"\", ...)` → `confirm_required`, attempts→1. `badConfirm` → `bad_confirm`, attempts→2. `confirmResp` with correct token → the early check `if (current.attempts >= MAX_CODE_ATTEMPTS)` → 2 < 5, OK. Then code hash matches, confirmToken matches → `issueDevice` → success. Good.\n\nBut — what about IP rate limiting `redeemRateLimited(ip)`? All these requests come from the probe (same IP \"local\"/127.0.0.1). The limiter allows 10/min. I have: onlyCode, badConfirm, oldRedeem, confirmResp, replay = 5 confirm/redeem calls + §30's redeem (on a DIFFERENT server instance, so separate `redeemHits` map). Actually — `redeemHits` is module-level in index.ts, so it's per server PROCESS. §31 restarts the server → fresh map. So 5 calls within §31, all < 10. Good. Plus the sessions/search calls don't hit the limiter. Fine.\n\nWait — actually, `oldRedeem` calls `/api/v1/pair/redeem` which FIRST checks `pairTwoStepEnabled()` and returns 410 BEFORE `redeemRateLimited`. So it doesn't increment the IP limiter. Good. And the 4 confirm calls increment it (4 < 10). Fine.\n\nNow — I need to add the cleanup for `.data/probe-http-pairing-2step.json` to the `leftovers` array. Let me check the cleanup list (line 2862+). Let me read it.\n\nAlso — issue: §31 restarts the server at the END, and the `finally` block does `server.kill()`. The new server (from §31) is the one killed. Good. But I need to make sure `server` variable is reassigned properly (it is: `server = startServer(...)`). Good.\n\nLet me also double-check: the probe's `waitForReady()` — after `server.kill()` + `await sleep(800)` + `startServer`, I call `await waitForReady()`. Good.\n\nHmm — one concern: `startServer({ PAIR_TWO_STEP: \"true\", PAIRING_STORE_PATH: \".data/probe-http-pairing-2step.json\" })`. The `extraEnv` is spread AFTER the defaults (`...extraEnv` at line 72), so it OVERRIDES `PAIRING_STORE_PATH` default. Good.\n\nNow — let me also reconsider: should §31's `sessions/search` test call `getHarness()`? Yes, `searchSessions(await getHarness(), ...)`. In the probe with faux, `getHarness()` should work. Let me verify after running. If it fails (500), I'll add a guard.\n\nActually — hold on. Let me reconsider a potential issue: `getHarness()` opens durable and `harness.resume()`. In the http probe, the server already has a harness (maybe from other tests). Calling `getHarness()` again returns the cached harness (lifecycle.ts caches `opened`). So it's fine. Actually — the probe's server for §31 is FRESH (just restarted), so `getHarness()` will open it fresh. `Harness.open` needs `storage` (DB path) — provided by `AGENT_DB_PATH` from startServer. Good. And `currentModels` accessor — with faux provider, there's a faux model. Good. So `getHarness()` works.\n\nHmm — but actually, let me reconsider: `searchSessions` also calls `readChatTitles()` which reads `AGENT_CHAT_META_PATH` (default `.data/chat-meta.json`). The probe doesn't set that path — so it reads the REAL `.data/chat-meta.json`? Wait — the probe runs in `apps/server` cwd. `.data/chat-meta.json` might not exist → `readChatTitles()` returns `{}` (catch). Fine, no error. But it could READ the real dev file — but it's read-only, harmless. Actually — the probe should isolate this. Hmm — `readChatTitles()` catches errors and returns `{}`. If the file exists (dev data), it reads titles but only uses them for hit titles. With no hits, no effect. Fine. Actually — to be safe, let me not worry.\n\nOK let me write the probe edits. First, line 2811."
      }
    ],
