le message. Hmm. Actually — for a \"找旧事\" UI feature, a 500 when there's no durable would be a poor experience. But adding a try/catch that returns `{hits:[]}` would \"冒充已知\" (pretend no results when actually the service errored). AGENTS.md says \"未测量的不冒充已知\". So a 500 (honest error) is better than a fake empty result. Let me leave it. Actually — the frontend shows \"查找失败（500）\" which is honest. Good.\n\n6. Let me reconsider the `findAroundIndex` + `openChat` read-only concern once more. `openChat(hit.conversationId)` with a non-empty id → read-only. Confirmed. Good.\n\n7. §3: I added `vision` to `AuxUse`. Let me double-check `AUX_USES` isn't used in a way that assumes 4 elements elsewhere (e.g., a probe that loops and builds env var names). I grepped — only auxiliary.ts + auxiliary.test.ts. Good.\n\n8. Hmm — one thing: the docs §2.5 says `AGENT_SESSIONS_SEARCH=false` → 404, \"与工具上架开关 AGENT_RECALL_SESSIONS 分开\". Correct.\n\n9. Let me reconsider the change record's test count: \"710 条全绿（本批前 684；新增 6+3+3+2 … 等）\". Let me verify: 710 - 684 = 26 new tests. My additions:\n   - pairing.test.ts: 6 tests (two-step).\n   - session-search.test.ts: 3 tests (params, results, findAroundIndex fallback).\n   - auxiliary.test.ts: 2 tests (title/vision warn, wired uses don't warn) + 1 assertion change (not a new test).\n   That's 6+3+2 = 11. But 710-684 = 26. Hmm — discrepancy. Wait — the batch 26a change record said \"689 条全绿（本批前 684；新增 8+1+4）\" — 684 + 13 = 697, but it said 689. So my \"684\" baseline is wrong — the previous count was already higher. Let me not claim a specific baseline. Actually — I wrote \"本批前 684\" which is likely WRONG (from the batch 26a doc which was an older snapshot). The current full run was 710. Let me check: how many tests were there BEFORE my changes? I don't know exactly. Let me not assert a specific \"本批前 N\" number. Let me fix the change record to just say \"710 条全绿\" without the wrong baseline. Actually — let me compute: my new tests = 6 (pairing) + 3 (session-search) + 2 (auxiliary) = 11. So before my changes it was 710 - 11 = 699. Hmm — but there might be other batches between 26a (689) and now. Actually — batch 27 is in progress (another session editing injection.ts/lifecycle.ts) — but I shouldn't count their in-progress work. Hmm — but the test suite includes `src/agent/injection.test.ts` etc. If the other session added tests, the count could differ. But I ran the full suite at 710, which includes whatever is currently in the worktree (including possibly the other session's in-progress changes to injection.ts — but those are NOT in git status as modified, so they might be committed or in another worktree). Actually — git status showed injection.ts NOT modified. So the other session works in a DIFFERENT worktree. So this worktree's test count is stable at 710.\n\nLet me just remove the wrong \"本批前 684\" claim and the made-up breakdown. Let me fix that line to be honest: \"710 条全绿（含本批新增 11 条：配对 6 / 搜索 3 / auxiliary 2）\". Let me verify my count: pairing.test.ts new tests = let me count: \"两段式成功\", \"只扫码不能完成\", \"confirmToken 错\", \"两段式过期\", \"一次性\", \"开关回滚\" = 6. session-search.test.ts new = \"搜索端点参数\", \"搜索端点结果\", \"findAroundIndex 兜底\" = 3. auxiliary.test.ts new = \"title / vision 无调用点\", \"已接用途 extract / review 不触发\" = 2. Total = 11. Good. Let me update the change record.\n\nAlso — the http probe section count: I don't have an exact number. Let me not claim one. The change record says \"端到端全部通过\" which is accurate.\n\nLet me fix the change record line.",
